{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260511/entry_horizontal_6a0264e30e378355ed754983_1778542847489_640x360.jpg\"><p>龍湖集團上月的合同銷售額，按年跌超過四成三。</p><p>按月跌近百分之4，至接近29億元人民幣。累計今年首四個月，合同銷售額103.5億元人民幣，減少五成三。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T00:16:58.915573+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}